+                ("1.1. VoidGram is an unofficial Telegram client. It is not affiliated with or endorsed by Telegram FZ-LLC, Telegram Messenger Inc. or the AyuGram authors.", false),
+                ("1.2. The app is provided \"as is\", without warranty of any kind, express or implied.", false),
+                ("1.3. Not having read this agreement does not exempt you from it. If you did not read it, that is your responsibility, not the fault of the VoidGram authors.", false),
+                ("2. Lawful use", true),
+                ("2.1. I will not use VoidGram for anything illegal: watching people without their knowledge, stalking, blackmail, fraud, spam, spreading other people's personal data or intimate material without consent, or any other content the law forbids.", false),
+                ("2.2. I am responsible for following my country's laws on personal data, private correspondence and privacy, and Telegram's Terms of Service.", false),
+                ("3. Deleted and view-once messages", true),
+                ("3.1. The VoidGram authors NOWHERE and under NO circumstances take responsibility for preserving deleted messages, view-once / self-destructing messages and media, edit history or any other data.", true),
